ourse cards and placement buttons must resolve to the correct dedicated internal page, not a generic official-site redirect.</li></ul></section><p class="small">Dashboard baseline: 1 September 2026 · Last refreshed 2026-10-17 15:25:08 UTC. Benchmark pages are excluded from modification.</p></main><script defer="" src="/no-hash-navigation.js?v=20261010"></script>
