 </head><body><header class="hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">IIM Amritsar Executive MBA</p><h1>IIM Amritsar Executive MBA</h1><p class="hero-subtitle">Admission 2027, Fees, Eligibility &amp; Selection</p></div></header><div class="page-shell container"><aside class="sidebar"><h3>On this page</h3><ul><li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li><li><a href="#eligibility">Eligibility</a></li><li><a href="#selection">Selection</a></li><li><a href="#fees">Fees</a></li><li><a href="#dates">Important Dates</a></li><li><a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></li></ul></aside><main class="content"><details class="mobile-on-page"><summary>On this page</summary><ul><li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li><li><a href="#eligibility">Eligibility</a></li><li><a href="#selection">Selection</a></li><li><a href="#fees">Fees</a></li><li><a href="#dates">Important Dates</a></li><li><a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></li></ul></details><h2 id="overview">IIM Amritsar Executive MBA Overview</h2><p>The IIM Amritsar Executive MBA is a two-year degree programme designed for working professionals. The institute's current criteria require a bachelor's degree, at least three years of progressive managerial, entrepreneurial or professional work experience after graduation, and a valid CAT/GMAT/GRE/GATE score or the IIM Amritsar Admission Test (IAAT).</p><hr/><h2 id="eligibility">IIM Amritsar Executive MBA Eligibility</h2><ul><li>Bachelor's degree in any discipline with consistent academic performance.</li><li>Minimum 3 years of progressive work experience after graduation.</li><li>Valid CAT, GMAT, GRE or GATE score, or IAAT as the alternative institute test.</li></ul><p>The institute's current admission criteria also specify score-validity rules for GMAT, GRE and GATE for the stated admission cycle.</p><hr/><h2 id="selection">IIM Amritsar Executive MBA Selection Process</h2><p>Shortlisted candidates are assessed through an online Personal Interview. The institute's FAQ states that candidates can be shortlisted using CAT/GMAT/GRE/GATE/IAAT scores and are then assessed comprehensively.</p><hr/><h2 id="fees">IIM Amritsar Executive MBA Fees</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Fee component</th><th>Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Programme fee</td><td>₹12,00,000</td></tr><tr><td>Application fee</td><td>₹2,950</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The official programme-fee page lists ₹12 lakh excluding the application fee. The institute's FAQ says the ₹12 lakh programme fee is payable in six instalments before the start of each academic term.</p><hr/><h2 id="dates">IIM Amritsar Executive MBA Important Dates</h2><p>Dates can change by intake. Students should use the official Executive MBA application portal for the active cycle rather than carrying forward dates from an earlier intake.</p><hr/><h2 id="faqs">IIM Amritsar Executive MBA FAQs</h2><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What is the IIM Amritsar Executive MBA fee?</summary><p>The official programme-fee page currently lists ₹12 lakh, excluding the ₹2,950 application fee.</p></details><details><summary>How much work experience is required?</summary><p>The current eligibility criteria require at least three years of progressive work experience after graduation in a managerial, entrepreneurial or professional role.</p></details><details><summary>Is CAT mandatory for the Executive MBA?</summary><p>No single test is mandatory if you use an accepted alternative. The institute lists CAT, GMAT, GRE and GATE scores and also provides IAAT as an alternative admission test.</p></details></div></main></div><script src="iim-amritsar-on-page.js"></script>
