 </head><body><header><h1>IIM Nagpur MBA Admissions 2026-28</h1></header><nav><ul><li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li><li><a href="#admissions">Admissions</a></li><li><a href="#placements">Placements</a></li><li><a href="#faq">FAQs</a></li></ul></nav><section id="quick-answer"><h2>Quick Answer</h2><p>The IIM Nagpur MBA 2026-28 is a two-year full-time residential programme with a batch size of 340. The total fee is Rs. 21,00,000. Admission is based on CAT 2025 scores, personal interviews, and a composite score including academic performance and diversity factors.</p></section>
 <hr/><section id="overview"><h2>Programme Overview</h2><p>IIM Nagpur offers a two-year full-time residential Master in Business Administration (MBA). The pedagogy includes case studies, simulations, projects, and industry interactions. The curriculum covers areas such as Finance &amp; Accounting, Marketing, Strategy &amp; Entrepreneurship, and Decision Science.</p></section><hr/><section id="admissions"><h2>Admissions Policy</h2><p>Admission for the 2026-28 batch follows a three-stage process:</p><ul><li><strong>Stage 1:</strong> CAT 2025 eligibility screening.</li><li><strong>Stage 2:</strong> Shortlisting for Personal Interview (PI).</li><li><strong>Stage 3:</strong> Final selection based on a composite score.</li></ul><h3>Selection Weights</h3><table><tr><th>Component</th><th>Weight</th></tr><tr><td>CAT Score</td><td>45%</td></tr><tr><td>Personal Interview</td><td>25%</td></tr><tr><td>Work Experience</td><td>9%</td></tr><tr><td>Past Academic Performance</td><td>6%</td></tr><tr><td>Gender Diversity</td><td>10%</td></tr><tr><td>Academic Diversity</td><td>5%</td></tr></table><p><strong>CAT 2025 Minimum Cut-offs (General):</strong> 95 Overall / 70 Sectional.</p></section><hr/><section id="placements"><h2>Placement Statistics</h2><table><tr><th>Year</th><th>Average CTC (LPA)</th><th>Median CTC (LPA)</th></tr><tr><td>2023-25</td><td>18.07</td><td>17.03</td></tr><tr><td>2022-24</td><td>16.29</td><td>16.00</td></tr><tr><td>2021-23</td><td>16.74</td><td>16.85</td></tr></table></section><hr/><section id="faq"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>What is the total fee for the MBA programme?</h3><p>The total fee for the MBA 2026-28 programme is Rs. 21,00,000.</p><h3>Are there scholarships available?</h3><p>Yes, IIM Nagpur offers 10 Merit and 10 Need-cum-Merit scholarships.</p></section><footer><p>Official Sources: <a href="https://www.iimnagpur.ac.in/admissions/mba/admissions-policy/">Admissions Policy</a> | <a href="https://www.iimnagpur.ac.in/programmes/mba/placements/placement-reports/final-placement-reports/">Placement Reports</a></p></footer>
