 </head><body><header><h1>Post-Graduate Program in Management for the Centrally Funded Technical Institutions (PGPMCI)</h1></header><nav><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#curriculum">Curriculum</a><a href="#admissions">Admissions</a><a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></nav><section id="overview"><h2>Programme Overview</h2><p>The PGPMCI is a specialized degree-granting programme offered by IIM Visakhapatnam, an Institution of National Importance under the IIM Act 2017. It is designed specifically to cater to candidates from Centrally Funded Technical Institutions (CFTIs) and Institutions of National Importance (INIs).</p></section><section id="curriculum"><h2>Curriculum &amp; Specialisations</h2><p>The programme focuses on advanced managerial learning and strategic decision-making. Specific specialisation tracks and detailed curriculum modules for PGPMCI are currently not published in the official online programme documentation.</p></section><section id="admissions"><h2>Admissions &amp; Career Outcomes</h2><p>Admission processes at IIM Visakhapatnam typically utilize multiple parameters including academic background, work experience, and personal interviews. Official data regarding placement reports, career outcomes, and specific fee structures for the PGPMCI programme are currently unavailable on the official website.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Eligibility</td><td>Candidates from CFTIs/INIs</td></tr><tr><td>Selection Process</td><td>Academic, Experience, Interview</td></tr><tr><td>Fee Structure</td><td>Official information unavailable</td></tr><tr><td>Placement Support</td><td>Official information unavailable</td></tr><tr><td>Cutoff Scores</td><td>Official information unavailable</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section id="faqs"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><dl><dt><strong>What is the PGPMCI programme?</strong></dt><dd>A specialized programme for candidates from Centrally Funded Technical Institutions (CFTIs) and Institutions of National Importance (INIs).</dd><dt><strong>Where can I find the latest brochure?</strong></dt><dd>Prospective students are encouraged to contact the IIM Visakhapatnam admissions office directly as specific programme brochures for PGPMCI are not currently published online.</dd></dl></section><footer><section><p>Source: <a href="https://www.iimv.ac.in">IIM Visakhapatnam Official Website</a></p></section></footer>
