 </head><body><header><div class="hero"><h1>Indian Institute of Management Visakhapatnam</h1><p>Institution of National Importance under the IIM Act 2017</p></div></header><nav><a href="#quick-answer">Quick Answer</a><a href="#admissions">Admissions</a><a href="#programmes">Programmes</a><a href="#placement">Placements</a><a href="#faq">FAQs</a></nav><section id="quick-answer"><h2>Quick Answer</h2><p>IIM Visakhapatnam is an Institution of National Importance. The flagship <strong>Executive MBA (EMBA)</strong> is a two-year, blended-mode programme. Admissions are based on a composite score of entrance exam scores, work experience, and personal interviews. Official fee structures and placement data are not explicitly published in a consolidated table format on the public portal.</p></section><section id="admissions"><h2>Admissions &amp; Selection Logic</h2><p>The admission process evaluates candidates using multiple parameters to ensure a comprehensive assessment. Selection is based on a composite score derived from entrance examination scores, work experience, and personal interview (PI) performance.</p><h3>Eligibility Criteria</h3><table><tr><th>Category</th><th>Minimum Bachelor's Degree Marks</th></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>50%</td></tr><tr><td>NC-OBC / EWS</td><td>45%</td></tr><tr><td>SC / ST / PwD</td><td>40%</td></tr></table><p><em>Note: Official cutoff scores are not publicly disclosed by the institute.</em></p></section><section id="programmes"><h2>Academic Programmes</h2><p>IIM Visakhapatnam offers a diverse portfolio of programmes:</p><ul><li><strong>Degree Programmes:</strong> PGP, EMBA, Doctoral (PhD), Executive PhD, PGPMCI, EPGDPM, PGDMEx.</li><li><strong>Executive Education:</strong> Includes specialized certificates in AI-Driven General Management, Operations Management &amp; Analytics, Chief Human Resource Officer, Chief Financial Officer, and Strategic Investment Banking.</li></ul></section><section id="placement"><h2>Placement Overview</h2><p>Official placement statistics for the last three years are not available in the provided public documentation. The institute maintains a Career Development Services (CDS) department to facilitate placement processes, but detailed year-wise comparative reports are not currently accessible on the official website.</p></section><section id="faq"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>What is the duration of the EMBA programme?</h3><p>The EMBA programme is a two-year course comprising 740+ hours of interactive executive learning.</p><h3>Are there loan facilities available?</h3><p>Yes, IIM Visakhapatnam provides loan facility support through State Bank of India, Bank of Baroda, and Credilia.</p><h3>Where can I find official fee tables?</h3><p>Official fee bifurcations are not publicly available in a consolidated table format on the institute's website.</p></section><footer><section><p>Official Source: <a href="https://www.iimv.ac.in">IIM Visakhapatnam Official Website</a></p></section></footer><main><section class="quick-answer answer"><h2 id="section-1">Quick Answer</h2><p>This page summarises the official information available for this college and programme. Where the official material does not publish a figure or date, it is marked as unavailable rather than estimated.</p></section><nav aria-label="On This Page"><strong>On This Page</strong><ul><li><a href="#section-1">Quick Answer</a></li></ul></nav><hr/><section><h2>Official Sources</h2><p>Official sources used for this page:</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.iimv.ac.in/programs/executive-master-of-business-administration-emba/admissions/admissions-and-eligibility">Executive Master of Business Administration (EMBA) Admissions &amp; Eligibility</a></li><li><a href="https://www.iimv.ac.in/news-events/iim-visakhapatnam-opens-admissions-for-fourth-batch-of-executive-mba-programme">IIM Visakhapatnam opens admissions for fourth batch of Executive MBA programme</a></li><li><a href="https://www.iimv.ac.in/executive-education-detail