 </head><body><header><h1>IIM Nagpur MBA Programme</h1></header><nav><ul><li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li><li><a href="#admissions">Admissions</a></li><li><a href="#curriculum">Curriculum</a></li><li><a href="#placements">Placements</a></li><li><a href="#faq">FAQs</a></li></ul></nav><section id="overview"><h2>Programme Overview</h2><p>IIM Nagpur offers a two-year full-time residential flagship MBA programme. The curriculum integrates lectures, case studies, projects, and simulations. The programme includes an international immersion, field immersion, and a summer internship.</p></section>
 <hr/><section id="admissions"><h2>Admissions Policy 2026-28</h2><p><strong>Batch Size:</strong> 340 students.</p><p><strong>Selection Process:</strong> Three stages including CAT 2025 screening, Personal Interview (PI), and final selection based on a composite score.</p><table><tr><th>Category</th><th>Overall Cut-off</th><th>Sectional Cut-off</th></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>95</td><td>70</td></tr><tr><td>EWS/NC-OBC</td><td>85</td><td>55</td></tr><tr><td>SC</td><td>65</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>ST/DAP</td><td>40/40</td><td>30/25</td></tr></table><p><strong>Final Selection Weights:</strong> CAT (45%), PI (25%), Work Experience (9%), Past Academic Performance (6%), Gender Diversity (10%), Academic Diversity (5%).</p><p><strong>Fees:</strong> Total programme fee is Rs. 21,00,000. Acceptance fee is Rs. 1,00,000 (adjusted towards Term I).</p></section><hr/><section id="curriculum"><h2>Curriculum</h2><p>The curriculum covers core management areas including Decision Science, Finance &amp; Accounting, Marketing, Organizational Behaviour, and Strategy. Electives include Business Data Mining, Corporate Valuation, FinTech, and Supply Chain Management.</p></section><hr/><section id="placements"><h2>Placement Statistics</h2><table><tr><th>Year</th><th>Average CTC (LPA)</th><th>Median CTC (LPA)</th><th>Highest CTC (LPA)</th></tr><tr><td>2023-25</td><td>18.07</td><td>17.04</td><td>69.57</td></tr><tr><td>2022-24</td><td>16.29</td><td>16.00</td><td>38.40</td></tr><tr><td>2021-23</td><td>16.74</td><td>16.85</td><td>64.00</td></tr></table></section><hr/><section id="faq"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><dl><dt>What is the total fee for the MBA 2026-28 batch?</dt><dd>The total fee is Rs. 21,00,000.</dd><dt>Does IIM Nagpur offer scholarships?</dt><dd>Yes, the institute offers 10 Merit and 10 Need-cum-Merit scholarships.</dd></dl></section><footer><p>Official Sources: <a href="https://www.iimnagpur.ac.in/admissions/mba/admissions-policy/">Admissions Policy</a> | <a href="https://www.iimnagpur.ac.in/programmes/mba/placements/placement-reports/final-placement-reports/">Placement Reports</a></p></footer>
