 </head><body><header class="hero"><h1>Department of Hospital Management and Hospice Studies</h1><p>Jamia Millia Islamia (NAAC Accredited A++ Grade)</p></header><nav><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#admissions">Admissions</a><a href="#curriculum">Curriculum</a><a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></nav><div class="main-container"><section class="quick-answer"><h2>Quick Answer</h2><p>The Department of Hospital Management and Hospice Studies at Jamia Millia Islamia offers specialized academic programs in healthcare administration and palliative care. Admissions are conducted through the centralized JMI portal, and students are advised to consult the official JMI Prospectus for specific eligibility and cutoff details.</p></section>
 <section id="overview"><h2>Course Overview</h2><p>The Department of Hospital Management and Hospice Studies is a specialized academic unit at Jamia Millia Islamia. It is dedicated to the interdisciplinary study of healthcare administration and palliative care, preparing students for leadership roles in hospital systems and hospice organizations. The department operates under the university's Academic Council guidelines.</p></section><section id="admissions"><h2>Admission &amp; Selection Logic</h2><p>Admission is conducted through the centralized Jamia Millia Islamia admission process. Selection is based on merit, typically determined by entrance examinations as specified in the annual university prospectus.</p><h3>Admission Details</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Admission Process</td><td>Centralized via JMI Admissions Portal</td></tr><tr><td>Eligibility</td><td>Refer to official JMI Prospectus</td></tr><tr><td>Selection Logic</td><td>Entrance Examination / Merit-based</td></tr><tr><td>Fee Structure</td><td>Subject to university notification</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Cutoff Information</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Year</th><th>Cutoff Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Current Cycle</td><td>Data unavailable in public domain</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section id="curriculum"><h2>Curriculum &amp; Specialisations</h2><p>The curriculum integrates healthcare management principles with hospice studies. Students are advised to consult the <a href="https://www.jmi.ac.in/ACADEMICS/Academic-Curricula/Regular-Programme">official JMI Academic Curricula portal</a> for detailed semester-wise breakdowns and credit requirements.</p></section><section id="faqs"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="faq-item"><h3>Where can I find the latest admission notifications?</h3><p>Official notifications are published on the <a href="https://www.jmi.ac.in/ACADEMICS/Admissions/Admission-Notifications">JMI Admissions portal</a>.</p></div>
